122
00:05:31,735 --> 00:05:34,384
In his 2021 book,

123
00:05:34,384 --> 00:05:36,885
he describes a rising power,

124
00:05:36,885 --> 00:05:39,975
China, challenging the established one.

125
00:05:40,295 --> 00:05:42,535
Still, nothing is set in stone.

126
00:05:42,855 --> 00:05:45,454
China's population shrank again in

127
00:05:45,454 --> 00:05:48,114
2025, real estate has struggled,

128
00:05:48,114 --> 00:05:50,775
and trade tensions keep piling up.

129
00:05:51,095 --> 00:05:53,415
But one thing has already shifted.

130
00:05:53,735 --> 00:05:56,024
The country once accused of copying

131
00:05:56,024 --> 00:05:58,375
